{"synopsis":"Kang Geon, 17 tahun. Pindah ke sekolah bergengsi yang hanya dimasuki oleh 0,1% teratas di Korea Selatan.\n\nSejak usia lima tahun, ia telah dibesarkan di Korea Utara sebagai agen rahasia. Senjata manusia sekaligus jenius dan mendapat tugas untuk menyusup ke kalangan atas Korea Selatan guna membangun jaringan koneksi.\n\nNamun, berteman justru menjadi misi yang lebih sulit. Bersama ayahnya, seorang peretas yang diawasi berbagai negara, dan ibunya, seorang pembunuh legendaris.\n\nDia hidup dengan keluarga samaran, sambil perlahan menemukan arti kebahagiaan yang sesungguhnya dalam drama aksi spionase ini!","alternative_title":"시크릿 패밀리","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"d85f455a-b396-44a3-8e4b-860185cd3e52","date":"2026-05-28","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"ab7c1cd1-fc7b-4f5e-a485-ca25759b5824","date":"2026-05-10","images":[]},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"b7c78e7e-c8d6-4bb1-b483-dc001bfd1169","date":"2026-05-07","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"8e8550a7-a6e7-40ed-944a-c59f9153cd7d","date":"2026-04-22","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"658f7d90-a531-433a-b677-9a05215dbb61","date":"2026-04-10","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"af0fa89d-4112-4735-825f-732eeb0e4a78","date":"2026-03-21","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"fbe73a9b-a2d9-46bf-88db-842e1194da4a","date":"2026-03-10","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"a2f8e0d4-56b7-4528-93c3-eb0f5dc9c5cb","date":"2026-02-14","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"19dd8395-2da2-4a4e-844d-e797e965f1d4","date":"2026-02-14","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"96b951fa-b879-4718-99a7-8b0d8cb56e99","date":"2025-11-13","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"11ae4cff-31d5-4202-9700-4ec9b90acb03","date":"2025-11-03","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"51b184f4-26cf-4f5c-b095-ab3aa5323132","date":"2025-10-31"